meta {
  name: List Settings
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Every runtime setting (AI, branding, limits) with its effective value and `source`: `db` (saved in Settings), `env` (from `.env`) or `default` (built-in). Precedence is db > env > default. Secrets (`AZURE_OPENAI_KEY`) return `set: true|false`, never a value.

  Requires a valid Bearer JWT ({{token}}).
  **Admin only.**
}
